 "2.png", "id": "146163027328423", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974864_146163030661756_6147462314113852275_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FM1U7gE7vjAQ7kNvwGiSz_7&_nc_oc=AdlJQZJXUXFItp182nr5vw9f3fp7ToRJ-l1wCk5N8YzJ4q1Ssu3ErBSFb_26ESzfH5g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv8rB-66KrmCfJKp7qpmzZlzCUEKQzmoxy31th13RTNsg&oe=69A6C120"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "941319500010102", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001691_941319503343435_2136109628830733637_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bQjeLF-AIWEQ7kNvwEu-p76&_nc_oc=AdnSAt0mxpE4N0gCZ6Ci6ocGLpb00xmrC3MHsAtYg810ZofpI8a446hrUpr7T3KUHP8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft_o7WjXqCIIDaBVxiKzs4yfuf9DpxUtfZu4dfQQRrf_Q&oe=69A6CC78"}, "display_name": "SweeperVR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Minesweeper has finally come to Virtual Reality! Flag, count, and open cells in this fully 3D reinvention of the classic game.\n\nFeatures:\n- View the entire minefield in cube view, or highlight an individual plane\n- Fully customizable minefield spawning parameters, with difficulty presets\n- Drag, drop, scale, and rotate the minefield to locate mines from any angle\n- Standard Minesweeper game mechanics and timer\n\nProfessional mine-defusers and newbies alike will be able to enjoy the challenges and gameplay of SweeperVR!", "short_description": "Minesweeper has finally come to Virtual Reality! Flag, count, and open cells in this fully 3D, yet familiar, reinvention of the classic game. Professional mine-defusers and newbies alike will be able to enjoy the challenges and gameplay of SweeperVR."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://awesomestuff.software/privacy-policy/SweeperVR.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Awesome Stuff Software", "support_website_url": "http://awesomestuff.software